<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="473940907"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1700472956"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Sound of Walking Away"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Kerli"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Sound of Walking Away"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:13.333"><div begin="00:12.412" end="03:45.374"><p begin="00:12.412" end="00:15.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I've been quiet aside you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经悄声无息地陪在你身边</span></p><p begin="00:15.808" end="00:18.558" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">While my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而火热的心 怦怦直跳</span></p><p begin="00:18.558" end="00:22.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">In my chest shouts</p><p begin="00:22.813" end="00:26.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Feeling silenced and lied to<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能在沉默中一次又一次地欺骗自己</span></p><p begin="00:26.602" end="00:29.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">But enough<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但现在适可而止吧</span></p><p begin="00:29.285" end="00:32.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Is enough</p><p begin="00:32.093" end="00:37.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Now don't come find me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别试图寻找我</span></p><p begin="00:37.834" end="00:39.793" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I won't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再原地等待</span></p><p begin="00:39.793" end="00:43.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Be here waiting</p><p begin="00:43.420" end="00:49.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">I so can do it alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我自己可以过得很好 你不值得我再多停留</span></p><p begin="00:49.880" end="00:54.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">You're not worth staying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不值得我再多停留</span></p><p begin="00:54.358" end="01:00.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Weren't listening but now there's no way you won't hear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不曾倾听 但现在你不得不听</span></p><p begin="01:00.036" end="01:05.232" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">There's a voice emerging in the night so loud and clear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">茫茫黑夜 有个声音在耳畔萦绕 嘹亮清晰</span></p><p begin="01:05.232" end="01:08.758" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">And I'll turn it up like you turn me down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论如何 我都要大声呼喊 无所畏惧</span></p><p begin="01:08.758" end="01:10.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I'm not afraid</p><p begin="01:10.570" end="01:13.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Hit play, hit play<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声音响亮 萦绕耳旁</span></p><p begin="01:13.305" end="01:15.772" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">It's the sound of walking away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是决然离开的声音</span></p><p begin="01:23.265" end="01:26.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">It's the sound of walking away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是决然离开的声音</span></p><p begin="01:34.725" end="01:37.116" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">It's the sound of walking away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是决然离开的声音</span></p><p begin="01:55.405" end="01:58.716" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">It's the sound of walking away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是决然离开的声音</span></p><p begin="01:58.716" end="02:02.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">I've been drowning inside you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾对你深深着迷 无法自拔</span></p><p begin="02:02.044" end="02:05.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">While my love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我的爱全部倾泻而出</span></p><p begin="02:05.156" end="02:09.525" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">It just pours out</p><p begin="02:09.525" end="02:12.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I've been running behind you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直望着你的背影拼命追赶</span></p><p begin="02:12.548" end="02:15.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">But enough<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是适可而止吧</span></p><p begin="02:15.781" end="02:18.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Is enough</p><p begin="02:18.448" end="02:24.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Now don't come find me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别试图寻找我</span></p><p begin="02:24.779" end="02:26.398" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I won't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再原地等待</span></p><p begin="02:26.398" end="02:29.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Be here waiting</p><p begin="02:29.864" end="02:36.492" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I so can do it alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我自己可以过得很好 你不值得我再多停留</span></p><p begin="02:37.402" end="02:40.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">You're not worth staying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不值得我再多停留</span></p><p begin="02:41.222" end="02:46.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Weren't listening but now there's no way you won't hear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不曾倾听 但现在你不得不听</span></p><p begin="02:46.818" end="02:51.842" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">There's a voice emerging in the night so loud and clear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">茫茫黑夜 有个声音在耳畔萦绕 嘹亮清晰</span></p><p begin="02:51.842" end="02:55.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">And I'll turn it up like you turn me down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论如何 我都要大声呼喊 无所畏惧</span></p><p begin="02:55.371" end="02:57.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I'm not afraid</p><p begin="02:57.267" end="02:59.883" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Hit play, hit play<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声音响亮 萦绕耳旁</span></p><p begin="02:59.883" end="03:02.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">It's the sound of walking away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是决然离开的声音</span></p><p begin="03:10.342" end="03:13.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">It's the sound of walking away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是决然离开的声音</span></p><p begin="03:42.081" end="03:45.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">It's the sound of walking away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是决然离开的声音</span></p></div></body></tt>